<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{.language}}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{.title}}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{.description}}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{.url}}">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{.url}}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{.title}}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{.description}}">
<meta property="og:image" content="{{.socialImage.src}}">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="{{.socialImage.alt}}">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" title="Instructions for agents" href="assets/agents/SKILL.md">
<link rel="preload" href="assets/fonts/martian-mono.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="assets/fonts/atkinson-hyperlegible-next.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{{style "assets/styles/main.css"}}
</head>
<body data-design-reason="Mono is the till display register type and the HUD label face, declared in concept.md Type">
<main>
<article class="hero-panel" aria-labelledby="headline">
<header class="till"><p class="brand">LFM.CASH</p><p class="hud today">Open today</p></header>
<div class="hero-grid"><div class="pitch"><h1 id="headline">Nobody screenshots a dead product.</h1><p class="lede">Sell before you build. Give your coding agent the prompt below: it researches buyers, builds your page, and lfm checks the page before you upload it.</p></div>
<div class="showcase" aria-label="Real pages built with lfm">
<figure class="screen devnews"><img src="assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Dev News first screen: release notes arranged by project"><figcaption>dev-news.anonyfox.com · built with lfm</figcaption></figure><figure class="screen squad"><img src="assets/images/built/squad-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/squad-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/squad-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Grok Bot Squad Kit product page first screen"><figcaption>lab.anonyfox.com/grok-bot-templates/ · built with lfm</figcaption></figure><figure class="screen sansslop"><img src="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Sans Slop product page first screen"><figcaption>lab.anonyfox.com/sans-slop/ · built with lfm</figcaption></figure><figure class="phone"><img src="assets/images/built/sansslop-phone-390.webp" width="390" height="844" alt="Sans Slop first screen at phone width"><figcaption>built with lfm</figcaption></figure></div>    <div class="offer" aria-labelledby="offer-h">
      <h2 id="offer-h">Paste this into your agent</h2>
      <form id="maker" class="maker" action="#offer-h">
        <label for="what">What do you sell? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
        <input id="what" type="text" placeholder="{{.data.prompt.example}}" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
        <div class="readout" id="readout">
          <p class="row small readout-head"><span>Order</span><span id="readout-what">{{.data.prompt.fallback}}</span></p>
          <p class="prompt" id="prompt" aria-live="polite">Make a landing page for <span id="prompt-what">{{.data.prompt.fallback}}</span> with&nbsp;lfm: <span class="url">{{.data.prompt.skill}}</span></p>
          <p class="row small readout-foot"><span>Sales today</span><span>$0.00</span></p>
          <p class="badge" aria-hidden="true">Copied</p>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="copy" id="copy">Copy my prompt</button>
      </form>
<p class="trust">Free under MIT. No account. <a href="assets/agents/SKILL.md">Read it first</a> · <a href="{{.urls.repository}}">Star on GitHub</a></p></div>
<figure class="terminal" id="terminal"><figcaption>01 / Agent default page · compile <button type="button" id="replay">Replay</button></figcaption>
<pre><code><span class="command t1">$ lfm compile</span><span class="line t2">error    seo.metadata  page
         Canonical URL is missing.
warning  design.defaults  page
         8 generator-default signals combine on this page; reported: eyebrow labels, hero badge;
…
oneshot-proj failed: 1 error, 15 warnings; output/ unchanged</span></code></pre>
<p class="hud line t3">02 / Sans Slop live page · check</p>
<pre><code><span class="command t3">$ lfm check https://lab.anonyfox.com/sans-slop/</span><span class="line t4">  8 files inspected; 0 errors, 0 warnings; 519 ms
Next (done): no findings remain.</span></code></pre></figure></div></article>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="compare-h"><h2 id="compare-h">One sentence in. What comes out?</h2><p>Different products. Drag to inspect the agent default and a page built with lfm.</p>
<div class="compare" id="comparison"><img src="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Sans Slop desktop product page: the researched output" loading="lazy"><div class="before"><img src="assets/images/built/default-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/default-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/default-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Threadly desktop: the default agent page with a trial button and repeated heading labels" loading="lazy"><span class="void-badge">VOID</span></div><span class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
<div class="compare-labels hud"><span>Agent default · {{.data.voided.errors}} error, {{.data.voided.warnings}} warnings</span><span>Sans Slop, built with lfm · lfm check: 0 errors, 0 warnings</span></div>
<label for="wipe">Compare pages: amount of agent default visible</label><input id="wipe" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-controls="comparison"><output id="wipe-value" for="wipe" aria-live="polite">50% agent default</output>
<ul class="chips"><li>Button contrast {{.data.voided.buttonContrast}}</li><li>{{.data.voided.lowContrastMore}} more low-contrast texts</li><li>{{.data.voided.defaults}} generator-default tells</li><li>6 heading labels</li><li>1 hero pill</li><li>Missing canonical</li><li>Missing share preview</li><li>Two links, one label</li></ul><p><a href="{{.urls.proofReport}}">Full report</a> · <a href="{{.urls.proofSource}}">Agent's file</a></p>
<details><summary>What the counts mean</summary><dl><dt>Input</dt><dd>One sentence requesting Threadly, a made-up Slack summarizer. No research, skills or lfm.</dd><dt>Compile count</dt><dd>Five unused config fields from the project wrapper excluded here, included in the terminal.</dd><dt>Browser audit</dt><dd>Run after fixing the canonical link. Adds the contrast finding.</dd></dl></details></section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="tally-h"><h2 id="tally-h">Demand first, product second.</h2><div class="tallies"><div><h3>The usual tally</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 300 90" role="img" aria-label="Building fills the tally; sales remain zero"><path class="bar" d="M0 15H290M0 45H240M0 75H10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="16"/></svg><p>Auth + billing: done<br>Dashboard: done<br>Replies: none</p><strong class="total">Sales $0.00</strong></div><div><h3>Sell-first tally</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 300 90" role="img" aria-label="Research, checked page, then selling"><path class="bar" d="M0 15H90M0 45H170M0 75H290" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="16"/></svg><p>{{.data.minimums.voices}}+ posts · {{.data.minimums.platforms}} platforms<br>{{.data.minimums.peers}} peers · {{.data.rules}} checks<br>Sell for 2 or 3 days</p><strong class="total">A sale or a no</strong></div></div><p>Building answers in seconds. A launch post answers in days, if at all. Zero users, zero replies, $0: start with the sale.</p><details><summary>Start with the sale</summary><ul><li>Post where the research found your buyers.</li><li>Deliver the first orders by hand.</li><li>No sale: days spent instead of months.</li><li>A sale: a product someone paid for.</li><li>Remove waitlist copy when checkout works. One founder left a pre-launch modal on the buy buttons for 90 days: $0.</li></ul></details></section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="after-h"><h2 id="after-h">After you paste</h2><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 600 60" role="img" aria-label="Connected steps from research to sale"><path d="M10 30H590M10 10V50M125 10V50M240 10V50M355 10V50M470 10V50M590 10V50" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg><ol class="process"><li>Agent installs one binary.</li><li>Agent reads {{.data.minimums.voices}}+ buyer posts.</li><li>Agent writes a cited concept.</li><li>Agent builds; checks reach zero warnings.</li><li>You add your payment link.</li><li>You upload output/ to any host.</li></ol><details><summary>What the agent asks</summary><dl><dt>You decide</dt><dd>The product, price, delivery and legal pages.</dd><dt>Web access</dt><dd>Search, browser or connectors; the agent reports sources it cannot reach.</dd></dl></details></section>
<section class="nodm" aria-labelledby="nodm-h"><h2 id="nodm-h"><s>Comment PROMPT and I'll DM you.</s></h2><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 600 80" role="img" aria-label="A crossed-out direct message"><path d="M215 20H385V65H215ZM215 20L300 52L385 20M200 75L400 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/></svg><p>No DM. Copy the prompt above.</p></section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="gallery-h"><h2 id="gallery-h">Pages lfm built</h2><div class="gallery"><figure><a href="{{.urls.sansslop}}"><img src="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/sansslop-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Sans Slop product page first screen" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Sans Slop</figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="{{.urls.squad}}"><img src="assets/images/built/squad-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/squad-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/squad-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Grok Bot Squad Kit product page first screen" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Grok Bot Squad Kit</figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="{{.urls.devnews}}"><img src="assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/devnews-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Dev News release notes homepage first screen" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Dev News · 43 pages</figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="{{.urls.devnewsGo}}"><img src="assets/images/built/devnews-go-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/devnews-go-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/devnews-go-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="Dev News Go release notes first screen" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Dev News / Go</figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="{{.urls.caseStudy}}"><img src="assets/images/built/case-desktop-720.webp" srcset="assets/images/built/case-desktop-720.webp 720w, assets/images/built/case-desktop-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 600px, 90vw" width="1200" height="750" alt="lfm case study first screen" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Two paid pages · case study</figcaption></a></figure></div><p>Product pages and a 43-page release-notes site. Open the case study for the agent’s work on the two paid pages.</p><details><summary>Won't it make the lfm look?</summary><p>AI slop has no single fix. Your buyers and competing pages decide the concept. <a href="{{.urls.concept}}">This concept</a> chose a till display from builders posting their $0.</p><p>lfm brings no traffic and hosts nothing.</p></details></section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="install-h" id="install"><h2 id="install-h">One binary. Your agent.</h2><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 600 80" role="img" aria-label="One lfm binary produces a checked output folder"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M10 10H180V70H10ZM200 40H390L375 25M390 40L375 55M410 20H460L475 10H590V70H410Z"/></g><g fill="currentColor" font-family="Martian Mono,monospace" font-size="18"><text x="65" y="47">lfm</text><text x="440" y="50">output/</text></g></svg><pre><code>{{.data.install.script}}</code></pre><p class="notes"><a href="{{.urls.newsInstall}}">Get release notes by email</a></p><p>Runs on macOS and Linux, on Intel and ARM. Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot.</p><details id="agents"><summary>Install details and agent instructions</summary><ol class="agent-steps"><li>Read <a href="assets/agents/SKILL.md">SKILL.md</a>.</li><li>Install with the <a href="assets/agents/install.sh">checksummed script</a> into ~/.local/bin, without sudo. Go 1.26+ alternative:<pre><code>{{.data.install.go}}</code></pre></li><li>Start a new project:<pre><code>lfm init my-page &amp;&amp; cd my-page
lfm skills install
lfm compile</code></pre></li><li>Compile after every change; follow the last line until it says deploy.</li></ol><dl><dt>JSON</dt><dd><code>lfm compile --json</code>: next.phase and next.skill. Exit 0: output/ written.</dd><dt>Existing pages</dt><dd><code>lfm check &lt;url&gt; --json</code></dd><dt>Skills</dt><dd>.agents/skills for Codex, Cursor, OpenCode and GitHub Copilot; .claude/skills for Claude Code.</dd><dt>Browser audit</dt><dd>Optional Chrome for <code>--release</code>; scrolls phone and desktop layouts and saves frames.</dd></dl><p><a href="assets/agents/llms.txt">llms.txt</a> · <a href="{{.urls.authoring}}">Authoring</a> · <a href="{{.urls.grokBot}}">Grok Bot</a></p></details><div class="file-output"><h3>Selling a file?</h3><p>{{.data.fileRules}} file checks. A checked file still needs a buyer. Sell it first.</p><dl><dt>Ebooks</dt><dd>EPUB and print PDF</dd><dt>Printables</dt><dd>PDF per paper size</dd><dt>Spreadsheets</dt><dd>.xlsx, every formula computed</dd><dt>Documents</dt><dd>.docx, real Word styles</dd><dt>Decks</dt><dd>.pptx with speaker notes</dd><dt>Bundles</dt><dd>Several deliverables behind one page</dd></dl></div><div class="coverage"><h3>What gets checked</h3><dl><dt>Page</dt><dd>Metadata, share previews, links, structured data, keyboard access, contrast and performance budgets.</dd><dt>Design</dt><dd>The palette and type in your concept, generator defaults, missing media and repeated layout patterns.</dd><dt>Publishing</dt><dd>One static output/ folder. Errors leave the previous folder unchanged. Each finding names a rule and a fix.</dd><dt>Release audit</dt><dd>Chrome scrolls at 390×844, 1280×680 and 1440×900; runtime, layout and Lighthouse checks run before deployment.</dd><dt>Your files</dt><dd>Project: research, concept and page source<br>Host: your choice, upload output/<br>Binary: checksummed GitHub release<br>Skills: plain files, readable before installation<br>Account: none<br>License: MIT<br>Paid tier: none</dd></dl></div><details><summary>This page's research</summary><p>{{.data.tally.voices}} <a href="{{.urls.voices}}">buyer posts</a> from {{.data.tally.platforms}} sites; {{.data.tally.peers}} <a href="{{.urls.competitors}}">competing pages</a>; {{.data.tally.directions}} directions, one kept. lfm is free: sales today $0.00.</p></details></section>
<footer><p>LFM: looking for more. <a href="{{.urls.license}}">MIT license</a> · <a href="{{.urls.news}}">Release notes by email</a> · <a href="{{.urls.impressum}}" lang="de">Impressum</a> · <a href="{{.urls.privacy}}" lang="de">Datenschutz</a></p><p>Thank you. Come back with a sale.</p></footer></main>
